# OOP=OBJECT ORIENTED PROGRAMMING

# Learning Object-Oriented programming from scratch to the practical implementation

## Topics Covered in the OOPS:
- Classes and Objects
- Attributes and Methods
- __init__ and self
- Instance and Class Attributes
- Instance, Class and Static Methods
- Encapsulation
- Inheritance
- Method Overriding
- Polymorphism
- Abstraction
- Composition
- Special Methods
